  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Mou F.",
      "stars": 5,
      "when": "قبل شهر",
      "text": "Easily one of those places that gets almost everything right. Excellent coffee and desserts, a beautiful space, and a team that makes every visit feel genuinely welcoming. The quality is consistent, the atmosphere is spot on, and the service deserves special credit.",
      "source_ref": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/%D8%A8%D8%B1%D9%88%D9%86%D8%A7+%D9%82%D9%87%D9%88%D8%A9+%D9%85%D8%AE%D8%AA%D8%B5%D8%A9+%7C+BRUNA+speciality+coffee/@26.9615601,49.6744579,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e35a1f4c7b1a59f:0x71262b602eed1848!8m2!3d26.9615601!4d49.6744579!16s%2Fg%2F11rcn4w8n6"
    },
    {
      "author": "Omar",
      "stars": 5,
      "when": "قبل 4 أشهر",
      "text": "Amazing experience at Bruna Specialty Coffee. Even though they were closing, the two barista girls welcomed us warmly and still served us with great hospitality. The Colombian V60 was excellent, and the San Sebastián cake was amazing too.",
      "source_ref": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/%D8%A8%D8%B1%D9%88%D9%86%D8%A7+%D9%82%D9%87%D9%88%D8%A9+%D9%85%D8%AE%D8%AA%D8%B5%D8%A9+%7C+BRUNA+speciality+coffee/@26.9615601,49.6744579,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e35a1f4c7b1a59f:0x71262b602eed1848!8m2!3d26.9615601!4d49.6744579!16s%2Fg%2F11rcn4w8n6"
    },
    {
      "author": "Faheem K.",
      "stars": 5,
      "when": "قبل 6 أشهر",
      "text": "Had a good evening spending hours at the beautiful cafe in jubail. A vibrant place having good cold and hot options. Their mango cake and custard deserts made the experience better with the coffee served. Recommended to visit",
      "source_ref": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/%D8%A8%D8%B1%D9%88%D9%86%D8%A7+%D9%82%D9%87%D9%88%D8%A9+%D9%85%D8%AE%D8%AA%D8%B5%D8%A9+%7C+BRUNA+speciality+coffee/@26.9615601,49.6744579,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e35a1f4c7b1a59f:0x71262b602eed1848!8m2!3d26.9615601!4d49.6744579!16s%2Fg%2F11rcn4w8n6"
